---
import { getGalleryImages } from '../lib/gallery-images';
import GalleryPhoto from './GalleryPhoto.astro';
const photos = (await getGalleryImages()).slice(0, 3);
---
<section id="mekanimiz" class="section shop-preview" aria-labelledby="shop-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEVŞEHİR’DE BULUŞALIM</p><h2 id="shop-title">Tatlı molanızın <em>bir köşesi var.</em></h2></div><p>Vitrinden cam kenarına,<br />Cappadokia Profiterol’den kareler.</p></div>
    <div class="shop-preview-grid">{photos.map((photo, index) => <GalleryPhoto photo={photo} index={index} preview />)}</div>
    <div class="shop-gallery-action"><p>Mekânımızı ziyaret etmeden önce keşfedin.</p><a class="button" href="/mekanimiz/">Tüm fotoğrafları gör <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
